	✅ Static inverter backup for AC essential bus (5 kVA, DC main powered)
	✅ Cross-feed protection (DC main uses highest-voltage TR)
	✅ 4-tier automatic load shedding cascade (heating→radar→avionics→critical)
	✅ Battery automatic failover to DC essential bus (when DC main fails)
	✅ Realistic TR voltage droop (28V no-load → 26V full-load)
	✅ Battery charge/discharge modeling (trickle charge when powered, endurance calculation)
	✅ Generator failure simulation (single gen ops, voltage sag modeling)
	✅ TR failure simulation (single TR ops, full-load capacity acceptance)
	✅ All 30+ electrical properties exposed (bus voltages, loads, switch state, failures)
